I play Nethack under Emacs and found it easy to hack that in.
http://sacha.free.net.ph/notebook/emacs/nethack-config.el has my
sacha/nethack-take-screenshot function. It takes a caption and adds
the map and status to ~/.nethack-notes. Add a C-u prefix to have it
overwrite (good for old games).

I use it to note where I dropped my spellbooks or where the stairs
are. Handy.

